	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TE Connectivity 2118718-2 STANDARD SHIELD FRAME (two-piece; cover is a separate part). Body 26.21 x 26.21 x 5.08 mm, 0.20 mm CRS with 1.25-3.00 um matte tin. Land pattern taken from the TE customer drawing ENG_CD_2118718_A2 sheet 2: 27.01 x 27.01 mm segmented ring, 1.00 mm wide; the gaps line up with the notches in the bottom of the frame wall, so route signals out through a gap. Clear internal cavity 25.81 x 25.81 mm; copper-free area inside the land ring 25.01 x 25.01 mm. Frame has an internal cross with a 6.00 mm pick-and-place pad at the TOP face, so the cavity below it is clear. Stencil 0.10 mm min.")
